~ start
do set_music("res://audio/music/awkward situtation.wav")
if !has_item("Coffee") and !has_item("L Coffee"):
	Old guy: How many times do I have to repeat myself?!
	Old guy: I just want one black coffee!
	Steph: As I said many times before sir, you have to pick a serving size before I can serve you!
	Old guy: Just one black coffee!
	Steph: Sir, It's store policy!
	Steph: I could get fired!
	Old guy: One.
	Old guy: Black.
	Old guy: Coffee.
	do set_music("res://audio/music/coffeeshop.wav")
else:
	Old guy: You people are so incompetent!
	Old guy: Why won't you let me go behind the counter and let me make one for myself?!
	Steph: Sir, that would violate several rules of conduct, I CANNOT let you do that.
	Old guy: Hmpf.
	do switch_uncs()
	Old guy: !
	Old guy: Heh, looks like this young gentleman beat me to it.
	do play_sfx("res://audio/sfx/menu sfx.wav")
	if has_item("L Coffee"):
		I give the old guy my L Coffee.
		do remove_item("L Coffee")
	else:
		I give the old guy my Coffee.
		do remove_item("Coffee")
	Old guy: Thank you good sir!
	do move_unc()
	do set_music("res://audio/music/coffeeshop.wav")
	do! close_eyelids()
	Steph: Oh finally!
	Steph: Thank you for dealing with that guy!
	Steph: Do you want something, anyway?
	do play_sfx("res://audio/sfx/menu sfx.wav")
	Steph added Good Coffee to my inventory!
	do move_people()
	I flip to the next page in my notebook.
	I start reading.
=> END